# 9gate (D77, D78): 9P2000 between nodes over Noise IK, its files at its
# export (9gate(4)). It dials and announces through /net, the stack's and
# cs's, and exports from its own namespace. Nothing listens until a
# client's ctl line says so.
service 9gate
program 9gate
use net
use cs
mount /net net/net
mount /net cs/net after
export
restart on-failure
